 "article": {
  "title": "AI in Everyday Life: From Helpers to Companions",
  "topic": "科技·人工智能",
  "level": "CET-4",
  "words": 322,
  "paras": [
   "Not long ago, artificial intelligence (AI) was a topic for scientists and science fiction writers. Today, it is part of our daily routine. When you ask your phone for the weather, let an app plan your route, or use a translation tool to chat with a foreign friend, you are already relying on AI. These smart helpers save time and make life more convenient, often without our noticing.",
   "In education and at work, AI is playing a bigger role. Students use intelligent learning apps that adapt exercises to their weak points, just like a patient tutor. In offices, AI tools summarize long reports, translate documents, and even help write emails. As a result, people can focus on creative thinking while machines handle repetitive tasks. Some experts believe AI will soon become a necessary companion in nearly every profession.",
   "However, the rise of AI also brings concerns. Privacy is one of them: every search, click, and voice command may be recorded and analyzed. Another worry is over-dependence. If students rely too heavily on AI for answers, their ability to think independently may weaken. Besides, not everyone has equal access to these powerful tools, which could widen the gap between rich and poor.",
   "The key is to find a balance. AI is a tool, not a replacement for human judgment. We should welcome its benefits while staying alert to its risks. Just as we learned to use the Internet wisely, we must learn to live with AI in a responsible way. The future is not about choosing between humans and machines, but about making them work together."
  ],
  "zh": "人工智能已从科幻走进日常：订天气、查路线、翻译聊天都在悄悄依赖它。学习和工作中，AI 像耐心的导师和高效的助手，让人专注于创造。但它也带来隐私泄露、过度依赖、数字鸿沟等担忧。关键在于平衡：把 AI 当工具而非替代，保持警惕、负责任地使用。",
  "hard": [
   {
    "en": "Students use intelligent learning apps that adapt exercises to their weak points, just like a patient tutor.",
    "cn": "学生们使用能针对薄弱点调整练习的智能学习应用，就像一位耐心的导师。",
    "why": "主干是 Students use apps；定语从句 that adapt exercises to... 修饰 apps；just like a patient tutor 是方式状语，把 AI 比作耐心的导师。"
   },
   {
    "en": "The future is not about choosing between humans and machines, but about making them work together.",
    "cn": "未来不是在人机之间做选择，而是让二者协作。",
    "why": "not...but... 并列结构：不是 A 而是 B；making them work together 是 make+宾语+宾补结构，them 指 humans and machines。"
   }
  ],
